  "body": "Positioned on a generous 321sqm corner site in the growing Strathmill community, this beautifully presented home offers a refreshing approach to modern living. With approximately 161.5sqm of total floor area, including a 20sqm deck, the thoughtfully arranged two-level design brings together three bedrooms, two bathrooms, an internal-access single garage and an elevated living space that makes the most of its surroundings.\r\n\r\nWhat makes this home particularly appealing is its distinctive layout. Rather than following a conventional floor plan, the main living areas are positioned upstairs, creating a wonderful sense of openness and separation from the bedrooms below. The spacious living and dining area is filled with natural light and complemented by a heat pump for year-round comfort. Large sliding doors extend the space onto an impressive elevated deck, where glass balustrades preserve the open outlook. Whether enjoying a morning coffee, entertaining friends or simply relaxing at the end of the day, this is a space designed to be enjoyed.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen complements the living space beautifully, featuring quality Bosch appliances, generous bench space and a practical island that provides an easy connection between cooking, dining and entertaining. Whether preparing everyday meals or hosting friends, the arrangement is both functional and welcoming.\r\nAlso located on the upper level, the master bedroom offers a comfortable retreat, complete with a built-in wardrobe, its own heat pump and a convenient semi-ensuite bathroom. Downstairs, two additional bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation, accompanied by a family bathroom and a dedicated laundry area. The internal-access single garage offers additional storage and provision for future EV charger installation, adding another layer of convenience for modern living.\r\n\r\nOutside, the generous corner section provides a welcome sense of space, with a landscaped lawn offering room for outdoor enjoyment. The elevated deck adds another dimension to the home, creating an inviting setting for entertaining while making the most of the surrounding outlook.\r\n\r\nLocated within Strathmill, one of Orewa's emerging residential communities, the property enjoys convenient access to Orewa township, local cafés, shops, schools and the beautiful Orewa Beach. With nearby motorway connections making commuting straightforward, this location combines the appeal of coastal living with everyday practicality.\r\nWith its elevated living spaces, generous corner position and thoughtfully considered layout, this is a home that offers something a little different. Come and discover the lifestyle waiting for you at 66 Ara Taha Crescent.",
